# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env is gitignored and never committed.

# TMDb API Key (v3 auth, 32-char hex string) - themoviedb.org account -> Settings -> API -> "API Key (v3 auth)".
# Decision (2026-07-29): the plugin uses the v3 api_key query-string scheme, not the v4 Bearer
# Read Access Token originally proposed in the research - both grant access to the exact same
# Discover/Watch Providers/image endpoints this plugin needs, v3 is simpler to wire up.
# Used only by the Jellyfin Provider Sections plugin itself (Seerr ships with its own bundled TMDb key
# for its own internal use, see docs/provider-sections/research/06-seerr-api-analysis.md).
TMDB_API_KEY=
